  BOOKED
  PICKED_UP
  IN_TRANSIT
  OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
  DELIVERED
  PARTIALLY_DELIVERED
  RETURNED
  CANCELLED
  HOLD
  LOST
  FAILED
  UNKNOWN
